<title>SOUTH AFRICA: GFSA'S Zinc Corp Q2 net increases.</title>
<headline>GFSA'S Zinc Corp Q2 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-June versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Net profit before capital spending  34.58 vs 25.22</p>
<p>    Capital spending			   3.14 vs 0.92</p>
<p>    Zinc output (tonnes)		  26,963  vs 27,041</p>
<p>    Zinc sold (tonnes)		    28,551  vs 29,766</p>
<p>    Sales				     171,71  vs 163,515</p>
<p>    Cost of sales			   132,37  vs 126,970</p>
<p>Full name: Zinc Corp of South Africa Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
